¤Ö␀␀¤Ş¤ã¤ä¤ï¤ğ¤öV¥GA/// The object whose identity is used by this key's [operator==].␀¦8¦0␀␀␀¦¦¥Q€Ç¥k␀␀¥n¥v␀␀¥Q¥R¦X‚#¦k␀␀␀¦X¦Y¤¤¨”™¯ª‡/// Describes the configuration for an [Element].
///
/// Widgets are the central class hierarchy in the Flutter framework. A widget
/// is an immutable description of part of a user interface. Widgets can be
