/// Once unmounted, a given [BuildContext] will never become mounted again.
///
/// {@macro flutter.widgets.BuildContext.asynchronous_gap}␀␀␀ÀyÙ‚ÉÀ|’‚“/// Whether the [widget] is currently updating the widget or render tree.
